      <activity id="0d4695e1-73f8-520d-9f46-26d2d07d1962" activityNameId="9978e8d8-6974-5a88-a24f-22442d289ddf" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Regional distribution, oil products</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Regional distribution, oil products
Bottom-Up estimation based on plant data. Life time is 40 years. Product storage volume of storage tanks is 10'000 m3. The average storage time is 2 months. Thus total through flow in the life time is 4.8 million. m3.;
UUID: 4f7cc4ce-e72a-389c-bae5-c6138af12706
Infrastructure (materials and land use) for storage tanks and petrol stations.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Tank storage and fuel stations.
Time period: Publication of literature.
Production volume: In 2015 total storage capacity in Switzerland was 7.5 Mio. m3.
Sampling: Literature and own estimations. 
Extrapolations: From CH to RER.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4f7cc4ce-e72a-389c-bae5-c6138af12706.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
